Package: gnome-shell-extension-myna
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         gnome-shell (>= 46),
         gnome-shell (<< 52),
         myna,
Description: GNOME Shell indicator for Myna dictation
 Myna Dictation Indicator hosts the myna-hud renderer as a focus-safe overlay
 at the bottom of the screen while the Myna dictation daemon runs: it shows
 the dictation state and the audio level, never the transcript.
 .
 Enable it with `gnome-extensions enable myna-shell@canonical.com` after
 logging in again.
